<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://indie-game-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:35:55 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>这款工具把 2D 绘画工作流带进 Unreal Engine 5</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/this-tool-brings-2d-painting-workflows-into-unreal-engine-5</link><description>Inky 工具在 UE5 里复现传统绘画材料的笔触质感，让美术可以直接用 2D 绘画方式做 3D 材质。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">06f563d4015b1e4207822d97add89bedf8236479</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/this-tool-brings-2d-painting-workflows-into-unreal-engine-5">80 Level</source></item><item><title>你的数据讲的是完整的故事吗？</title><link>https://unity.com/blog/data-fragmentation-ua-monetization-unity-vector</link><description>数据碎片化会让买量与变现团队看不清玩家全貌，文章讲了把 MMP、GA 与内购信号接入 Unity Vector 的代价与做法。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e42e5fdb3a4f172663c2be08260132c0acd45066</guid><source url="https://unity.com/blog/data-fragmentation-ua-monetization-unity-vector">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>Sensor Tower 推出网店收入预估工具</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/sensor-tower-introduces-web-store-revenue-estimates</link><description>Sensor Tower 新增直销网店收入预估，开发者现在能同时看到应用商店与自家网店的变现全貌。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:40:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b2b3a941eac58cadaae11d61a239d763a7c7e3fe</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/sensor-tower-introduces-web-store-revenue-estimates">PocketGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>Hydrilla 教程：从提示词到引擎，做出你的第一个 BlueFox 道具</title><link>https://dev.to/sugukavi/hydrilla-tutorial-your-first-bluefox-prop-from-prompt-to-engine-5d5k</link><description>一步步演示如何用 Hydrilla 的 BlueFox 1 从提示词或参考图生成带分段网格、UV 与 PBR 贴图的背景道具，并省着用生成额度。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:26:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaL